# cards: a basic version on one ally (docs/plan-cards.md 3). Lucia wears Comet (INT up, all allies; paired with
# Rufus's Stratagem, so hers is one ally) at 1300 points (0x020B48AE). Round 1: Jian Fights; Lucia's card entry
# opens the ally picker (shot ca_picker); A on the first portrait raises that ally's INT one stage (watches
# int_jian 0x0228E8A6, int_lucia 0x0228E912), points 1300 -> 1200. Round 2, both INT stages set to +1 first: the
# pick is refused ("No effect!", shot ca_refused), points stay 1200.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1C 1
poke u16 0x020B48AE 1300
poke u16 0x020B46FE 237
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u16 0x0228E8A6 int_jian
watch u16 0x0228E912 int_lucia
watch u16 0x020B48AE points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ca_pick
press A 8
wait 60
shot ca_picker
press A 8
wait 40
shot ca_after
wait 1500
shot ca_r2_start
poke u16 0x0228E8A6 1
poke u16 0x0228E912 1
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot ca_r2_picker
press A 8
wait 20
shot ca_refused
